description=Memory reclaim companion for the Cirno freezer, adapted for ColorOS 17: pages out frozen apps first and kills only when memory is still short, leaves ColorOS memory extension alone, C++ scheduler daemon with shell fallback, WebUI. First install runs in dry-run mode.
